可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"eef34a57-c82a-4995-877d-66b54b9589da\", \"memory_text\": \"Likes Persian cats because of their regal and calm nature, elegance, and historical charm\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"eef34a57-c82a-4995-877d-66b54b9589da\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Likes Persian cats because of their regal and calm nature, elegance, and historical charm\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"User likes Persian cats because of their regal and calm nature, elegance, and historical charm\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"eef34a57-c82a-4995-877d-66b54b9589da\", \"quote\": \"Likes Persian cats because of their regal and calm nature, elegance, and historical charm\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载用户喜欢波斯猫，因其高贵、冷静的天性、优雅和历史魅力。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"old-1\", \"quote\": \"I like persian cats, because I admire the regal and calm nature of Persian cats. Their presence adds a touch of elegance and history to my home.\", \"supports\": \"用于补足该偏好的主体为用户，并确认其喜欢波斯猫的原因。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"old-1\", \"source_ref\": \"dataset line 14, /sessions/2/dialogue/6\", \"text\": \"I like persian cats, because I admire the regal and calm nature of Persian cats. Their presence adds a touch of elegance and history to my home. I don't like parrots, because The constant noise and chatter of parrots can be quite distracting, especially when I'm focused on creating a quiet, historical atmosphere. I like greyhounds, because greyhounds have a noble history and a gentle demeanor that I find soothing and fitting for my lifestyle. I like tortoises, because their slow, deliberate movements remind me of the passage of time and history, which I find fascinating. I like British shorthair cats, because their calm and collected nature aligns with my preference for peace and quiet, and they have a historical charm.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 06, 2025, 22:24:16\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"text\": \"I recently attended a film festival and watched a fascinating documentary about Persian cats. It really deepened my admiration for their historical lineage and association with royalty.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Apr 10, 2026, 11:06:07\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-2\", \"text\": \"The history of Persian cats aligns perfectly with my interest in historical authenticity. However, I do reflect on the practical challenges of maintaining their regal appearance.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Apr 10, 2026, 11:15:58\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
